{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="page-root">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="main-nav">
        <a href="/about.html">About the Practice</a>
        <a href="/specialties.html">Areas of Focus</a>
        <a href="/approach.html">Our Way</a>
        <a href="/book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <button class="menu-toggle" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero"
      style="background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');">
      <div class="wrap hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1 class="title">A Quiet Compass for Thoughtful Change</h1>
          <p class="lede">Private, focused sessions with a therapist who helps you notice the next careful step. Short intensive offerings and deeper pathways for ongoing work.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn outline" href="/fees.html">See investment options</a>
          </div>
          <p class="contact-line">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-aside">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Session Planner</h3>
            <p class="muted">Build a short plan you can bring to your first meeting.</p>
            <form id="planner-form">
              <label>Primary focus</label>
              <select id="planner-goal">
                <option value="Navigate a transition">Navigate a transition</option>
                <option value="Manage anxiety or overwhelm">Manage anxiety or overwhelm</option>
                <option value="Improve relationships or boundaries">Improve relationships or boundaries</option>
                <option value="Short-term skill building">Short-term skill building</option>
                <option value="Other">Other</option>
              </select>

              <label>Number of sessions</label>
              <input id="planner-sessions" type="number" min="1" max="12" value="3">

              <label>Session length</label>
              <select id="planner-length">
                <option value="50 minutes">50 minutes</option>
                <option value="75 minutes">75 minutes</option>
                <option value="90 minutes">90 minutes</option>
              </select>

              <label>Any immediate concern to mention?</label>
              <input id="planner-note" type="text" placeholder="Brief note e.g., sleep, panic, relationship">

              <div class="planner-actions">
                <button id="planner-build" type="button" class="btn">Build plan</button>
                <button id="planner-copy" type="button" class="btn outline">Copy summary</button>
              </div>
            </form>
            <textarea id="planner-output" readonly aria-label="Session plan output">Your plan will appear here.</textarea>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pillars wrap">
      <h2>How I work — guiding principles</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="pillar card">
          <h3>Focused Practicality</h3>
          <p>We aim for clear steps that fit your life rhythm — tools and perspectives you can use between sessions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar card">
          <h3>Context Aware</h3>
          <p>Therapy is tailored to your roles and routines. We pay attention to the details that shape choices.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar card">
          <h3>Respect for Privacy</h3>
          <p>Sessions and records are treated with confidentiality and clinical boundaries.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-notes wrap">
      <h2>Illustrative notes</h2>
      <div class="note card">
        <p class="muted">(Anonymized summary used for learning)</p>
        <p>Client sought help while changing jobs. We mapped core values, set micro-practices for sleep and transitions, and tested a short sequence of three focused sessions. Progress was defined collaboratively, not guaranteed.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="myth-truth wrap">
      <h2>Myths & Clarities</h2>
      <dl class="mt-grid">
        <div>
          <dt>Myth</dt>
          <dd>Therapy always means long-term weekly commitment.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Clarity</dt>
          <dd>There are short focused options and intensives for specific goals alongside ongoing work when helpful.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Myth</dt>
          <dd>I will tell you what to do.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Clarity</dt>
          <dd>The work is collaborative; choices come from your goals and values with clinical framing.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="interactive wrap">
      <h2>Self-screening: Quick Check & Deep Check</h2>
      <p class="muted">These are non-diagnostic, reflective tools to help you bring useful questions to a consultation.</p>

      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card wizard">
          <h3>Quick Check</h3>
          <p class="muted">A short sequence that highlights current stresses and what you'd most want to address.</p>
          <form id="quick-wizard">
            <label>Primary area of concern</label>
            <select id="q1">
              <option>Stress/Anxiety</option>
              <option>Mood</option>
              <option>Relationship</option>
              <option>Work/career</option>
              <option>Other</option>
            </select>
            <label>How long have you noticed this?</label>
            <select id="q2">
              <option>Less than a month</option>
              <option>1–6 months</option>
              <option>More than 6 months</option>
            </select>
            <label>Are symptoms limiting daily functioning?</label>
            <select id="q3">
              <option>No</option>
              <option>Sometimes</option>
              <option>Often</option>
            </select>
            <div class="wizard-actions">
              <button id="quick-run" type="button" class="btn">Run Quick Check</button>
            </div>
          </form>
          <textarea id="quick-output" readonly>Results will appear here.</textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="card wizard">
          <h3>Deep Check</h3>
          <p class="muted">A guided five-step reflection that produces suggested questions to take to a first meeting.</p>
          <div id="deep-steps">
            <div class="step">
              <label>1) What matters most right now?</label>
              <input id="d1" type="text" placeholder="Brief phrase">
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <label>2) What have you tried so far?</label>
              <input id="d2" type="text" placeholder="Approaches or supports">
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <label>3) What would feel like progress?</label>
              <input id="d3" type="text" placeholder="Concrete change">
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <label>4) Practical barriers to working on this?</label>
              <input id="d4" type="text" placeholder="Time, logistics, emotion">
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <label>5) Any safety or urgent concerns?</label>
              <input id="d5" type="text" placeholder="If yes, mention at intake">
            </div>
            <div class="wizard-actions">
              <button id="deep-run" type="button" class="btn">Generate Questions</button>
              <button id="deep-copy" type="button" class="btn outline">Copy Questions</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <textarea id="deep-output" readonly>Suggested questions will appear here.</textarea>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="muted small">Notes: This is a non-diagnostic reflection tool. For emergencies or imminent harm, contact local emergency services or crisis resources in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Confidentiality applies within clinical norms; limits include concerns for safety and legal obligations.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="faq wrap">
      <h2>Common questions</h2>
      <dl>
        <dt>What kinds of sessions do you offer?</dt>
        <dd>Short focused packages, single-session intensives, and ongoing weekly work are available depending on your needs.</dd>
        <dt>Do you accept insurance?</dt>
        <dd>I am primarily a private-pay practice; I can provide a receipt if you seek reimbursement from your insurer.</dd>
        <dt>How is confidentiality managed?</dt>
        <dd>Records are kept securely. There are clinical and legal limits to confidentiality which will be discussed at intake.</dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="cta wrap">
      <div class="card">
        <h2>Ready to begin?</h2>
        <p>Schedule a brief consultation to see if we’re a fit. You can bring your planner and your questions from the Deep Check.</p>
        <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <p class="muted">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap foot-grid">
      <div>
        <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Private practice therapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p>
        <p class="small muted">Confidentiality and scope: Therapy offered here is supportive and collaborative. This site does not provide crisis services or medical advice. If you are in crisis or feel you may harm yourself or others, contact local emergency services immediately.</p>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="/about.html">About</a>
        <a href="/fees.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="/contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
